    "\n",
    "## Slices, strings, arrays, and pointers\n",
    "\n",
    "A string is immutable UTF-8 bytes: `[]const u8`. It is length-based, not zero-terminated. Slices and\n",
    "pointers borrow storage; they do not own it.\n",
